  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-18T08:33:49.164060Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-18T09:44:06.974838Z",
  "totalBlocks": 35,
  "translatedBlocks": 35,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4132b6f8783082a6",
      "translationZh": "MusicGen 是一个强大的音乐生成模型，它接收文本提示和可选的旋律作为输入，并输出音乐。这篇博文将指导你使用 Inference Endpoints，通过 MusicGen 生成音乐。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5c1d2def23c385a7",
      "translationZh": "Inference Endpoints 允许我们编写自定义推理函数，这类函数称为自定义处理器。当 transformers 的高层抽象 pipeline 无法开箱即用地支持某个模型时，这类处理器尤其有用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34e2ce32f67659b7",
      "translationZh": "transformers 的 pipeline 提供了强大的抽象，可用于对基于 transformers 的模型运行推理。Inference Endpoints 利用 pipeline API，只需点击几下即可轻松部署模型。不过，Inference Endpoints 也可用于部署没有 pipeline 的模型，甚至是非 transformer 模型！这是通过一个我们称为自定义处理器的自定义推理函数来实现的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c1d9d2d3b9d0bac2",
      "translationZh": "让我们以 MusicGen 为例来演示这一过程。要为 MusicGen 实现一个自定义处理器函数并将其部署，我们需要：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "200fcae7d098d2ac",
      "translationZh": "复制我们想要提供服务的 MusicGen 仓库，",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c583391a2fd8825f",
      "translationZh": "在 handler.py 中编写自定义处理器，在 requirements.txt 中列出所需的依赖项，并将这两个文件添加到复制的仓库中，",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8c17aa097fb37fdd",
      "translationZh": "为该仓库创建 Inference Endpoint。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef930838f8e4aa77",
      "translationZh": "或者，直接使用最终成果，部署我们的自定义 MusicGen 模型仓库；我们只是按照上述步骤完成了它 :)",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4455be73df06b0d1",
      "translationZh": "开始吧！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eee236522bc29771",
      "translationZh": "首先，我们将使用 repository duplicator，把 facebook/musicgen-large 仓库复制到我们自己的个人账号下。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f7f6797b6900648f",
      "translationZh": "然后，我们会将 handler.py 和 requirements.txt 添加到复制后的仓库中。首先，让我们看看如何使用 MusicGen 运行推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "63fa00a527dfa6a7",
      "translationZh": "来听听效果如何：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
      "translationZh": "您的浏览器不支持音频元素。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3434e3c8bc4cbcce",
      "translationZh": "你还可以选择使用一段音频片段作为输出的条件，也就是说，将根据文本生成的音频与输入音频相结合，生成一段与之互补的音频片段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b9d2e21caa86973d",
      "translationZh": "我们来听一听：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
      "translationZh": "您的浏览器不支持音频元素。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c032cbba186882bf",
      "translationZh": "在这两种情况下，model.generate 方法都会生成音频，并遵循与文本生成相同的原理。你可以阅读我们关于如何生成的博客文章，了解更多相关内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3af9e125f8051829",
      "translationZh": "好了！了解了上面的基本用法后，让我们部署 MusicGen，既享受乐趣，也创造收益！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4feb8f747974af2a",
      "translationZh": "首先，我们将在 handler.py 中定义一个自定义处理器。我们可以使用 Inference Endpoints 模板，并用自定义推理代码重写 __init__ 和 __call__ 方法。__init__ 将初始化模型和处理器，而 __call__ 将接收数据并返回生成的音乐。你可以在下方找到修改后的 EndpointHandler 类。👇",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca6efa6e443990a2",
      "translationZh": "为简单起见，在这个示例中，我们仅根据文本生成音频，不使用旋律作为条件。接下来，我们将创建一个 requirements.txt 文件，其中包含运行推理代码所需的所有依赖项：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5d74707e54408db",
      "translationZh": "将这两个文件上传到我们的仓库，就足以让模型提供服务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "586a1849d872a4a7",
      "translationZh": "现在，我们可以创建 Inference Endpoint 了。前往 Inference Endpoints 页面，点击 Deploy your first model（部署你的第一个模型）。在“Model repository”（模型仓库）字段中，输入你复制的仓库的标识符。然后选择所需的硬件并创建端点。任何至少具有 16 GB 内存的实例应该都能运行 musicgen-large。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "87aad76dc0ed0d9e",
      "translationZh": "创建端点后，它会自动启动，并准备好接收请求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16c43bd02c7b05a9",
      "translationZh": "我们可以使用下面的代码片段向端点发送查询。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b7da8e71f676e58",
      "translationZh": "我们可以看到，输出是如下波形序列。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b05223363810733",
      "translationZh": "它听起来是这样的：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
      "translationZh": "您的浏览器不支持音频元素。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "070cfdd0be3a608d",
      "translationZh": "你也可以使用 huggingface-hub Python 库的 InferenceClient 类来调用该端点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "88c60998f479bc48",
      "translationZh": "你可以按自己喜欢的方式将生成的序列转换为音频。你可以使用 Python 中的 scipy 将其写入 .wav 文件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fa3d7411d14b8ecd",
      "translationZh": "大功告成！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a789653572eeee46",
      "translationZh": "试用下方的演示，体验一下这个端点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df962d1d241ded01",
      "translationZh": "在这篇博文中，我们展示了如何通过自定义推理处理程序，使用 Inference Endpoints 部署 MusicGen。同样的技术也可用于 Hub 中任何没有关联流水线的其他模型。你只需重写 handler.py 中的 Endpoint Handler 类，并添加 requirements.txt，以列明项目的依赖项。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c29602f4775797f9",
      "translationZh": "延伸阅读",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "509b18a3d4def34b",
      "translationZh": "介绍 Custom Handler 的 Inference Endpoints 文档",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
